            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "After undersatnding the problem more (from the dbus-sensors side) I don't think this is appropriate to encode in entity-manager anyhow.  We're essentially wanting to encode driver-specific behavior into a FRU-specific config.  If this behavior is needed, dbus-sensors should know which driver-specific behavior to use; otherwise we have to replicate this information for every single FRU that uses \"affected PWM drivers\"."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/yosemite4_fanboard_fsc_max_adc_ti_led_nxp_efuse_max.json",
                    "line": 293,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This doesn't show up in a schema.  How does it pass?  Don't we need this added to a schema?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/yosemite4_fanboard_fsc_max_adc_ti_led_nxp_efuse_max.json",
                    "line": 293,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Connector schema is lacking \nthe \n```\n\"additionalProperties\": false\n```\nline\n```\n            \"Connector\": {\n                \"properties\": {\n                    \"Name\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"Pwm\": {\n                        \"type\": \"number\"\n                    },\n                    \"Tachs\": {\n                        \"items\": {\n                            \"type\": \"number\"\n                        },\n                        \"type\": \"array\"\n                    }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\"Name\", \"Pwm\", \"Tachs\"],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n            },\n```\n\nMaybe that line can be added as part of this patch, along with the new property being configured \ud83d\udc4d"
                }
            ],
